<title>UK: Dresdner Bank sets 2.0 bln Luxfr bond.</title>
<headline>Dresdner Bank sets 2.0 bln Luxfr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers BIL, Credit Europeen (joint books), Dresdner Lux and CCB</p>
<p> BORROWER   DRESDNER BANK LUX</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN FLUX  COUPON     6.0	 MATURITY    14.DEC.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.65    PAY DATE   L14.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA3/=     DENOMS (K) 50-250    YIELD	 5.62 PCT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> NOTES	L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
